      "finalTranslation": "“就当答谢那美味的面包！\n　全力上吧！！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "“就当答谢那美味的面包”自然表达パンのお礼；后句保留全力作战的决心。",
      "encodedSize": 42
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "09f5b56b-f863-4d5f-bc8b-3983a7f67525",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.19/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4edd3c3804fb4c86509454fd3b1c8df7f7686606b922b529d11ee4a846a31b25",
      "previousTranslation": "“那些家伙，不是秃鹰……\n　是训练有素的军队！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“那些家伙并不是秃鹰！\n　是训练有素的军队！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "清楚区分秃鹰与受训军队，保留卡洛德识别对方身份的判断。",
      "encodedSize": 46
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "3a3f59ff-8674-4f29-bbfb-ae1c25d3f9e6",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.19/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5b32506b0ae8faa646c33f80f502a244e30b43c151726fe31d9551091ecb1214",
      "previousTranslation": "“他们从哪来，打算干什么！？”",
      "finalTranslation": "“他们从哪来，究竟打算干什么！？”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "“究竟”加强对军队来历和意图的疑问，未改变原句含义。",
      "encodedSize": 35
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "87ec4331-ddca-419a-835e-56a44266c421",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.20/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "30cf7bdee4614c28a5cf4b750345a66392868ec30c31ae933c045fbd47f5bacf",
      "previousTranslation": "“刚以为被传送到了阿美利亚，\n　马上就碰上这种事。”",
      "finalTranslation": "“刚思考怎么被传送到了阿美利亚，\n　没想到转眼就碰上这种事啊。”",
      "choice": "submitted",
      "reason": "用户在本轮审阅页确认：submitted",
      "confirmedAt": "2026-10-05T13:23:56.305487+00:00",
      "encodedSize": 64
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "279cfd65-b7d9-44b7-8eb9-ee7d09d83e7c",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.20/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bb885c595251c6a7d6ea92ca5ea8a732b4c3741dddc9438bdd7354e4c3f31811",
      "previousTranslation": "“真是的……人生还真不无聊啊！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“真是的！\n　人生还真是一刻都闲不下来啊！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "该隐正在感叹刚被传送便卷入战斗，“一刻都闲不下来”自然表达退屈しない人生的调侃。",
      "encodedSize": 44
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "7e1f4d4a-3693-477d-8cf9-c94ee025679b",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.22/0001",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "53609c66dbd8bf1a04165c2d3d2ca6d6e371ddb3b3d629c16ee53e1401ee96ff",
      "previousTranslation": "“是你们擅自开打，\n　把我们卷进来的！觉悟吧！！”",
      "finalTranslation": "“是你们擅自开打，把我们卷进来的！\n　错可都在你们那！做好觉悟吧！！”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "补出お前らが悪い的“错在你们”，并保留擅自开战、卷入我们及做好觉悟的三层信息。",
      "encodedSize": 70
    },
    {
      "suggestionId": "5a481040-dddf-4f5d-8ae6-012ffe2fb4ec",
      "targetId": "story/019/dialogue/01.15/0000",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "sourceTextSha256": "61ec8a5cb8610d4e340ddc329df639dc1f73432f3bb4cab14bd7b41eaac4ce98",
      "previousTranslation": "“回去了……”",
      "finalTranslation": "“总算……回去了”",
      "choice": "auto-accepted-submission",
      "reason": "前文是波宣布撤退，罗兰这句对敌方离去松了一口气；“总算”准确表达くれた的庆幸。投稿理由所说“自己人回去”不符合前文，但译文本身可采纳。",
      "encodedSize": 19
    },
    {
